      "statement": "Strimzi 0.46.0 removed support for ZooKeeper-based Kafka clusters and ZooKeeper-to-KRaft migration. Only environments with a Kafka cluster still running on ZooKeeper or mid-migration are exposed; KRaft clusters are not. The evidence does not name the setting that identifies ZooKeeper mode."
    },
